WEBVTT

00:04:59.954 --> 00:05:01.246
they say.

00:05:02.204 --> 00:05:05.829
No promotion, no mentor, no votes.

00:05:05.871 --> 00:05:09.496
We cannot compete in the costume contest

00:05:09.538 --> 00:05:11.204
without a costume

00:05:11.246 --> 00:05:12.621
and expect to win.

00:05:14.788 --> 00:05:18.454
The call to brave work
with more authenticity

00:05:18.496 --> 00:05:21.663
undeservedly disadvantages
people of color.

00:05:22.621 --> 00:05:24.871
Those of us who are already burdened

00:05:24.913 --> 00:05:29.121
with the task of chronically
battling bias.

00:05:29.163 --> 00:05:32.746
With precision, the work to shift culture